From c5ca4695cb460d5c33bb733ad55ea99db6750b99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yosa-Shiawase <yosa-shiawase@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 16:58:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Dart compile errors and verify with Flutter 3.47.9

- music_service: use real youtube_explode_dart 2.x API (TypeFilters,
  video.author, thumbnails.highResUrl) + just_audio playback integration
- app.dart: fix theme.of -> Theme.of, add services import
- settings_page: fix service_locator import path (file now exists)
- pubspec: add missing shared_preferences dependency
- theme: remove nonexistent ThemeData.brightness param
- ci: add setup-java temurin 21, analyzer excludes, regenerate scaffold
- test: replace stale counter template with model roundtrip tests
- verified: flutter analyze = 0 errors, flutter test = 3/3 pass
